{
  "format": "monolith-mission/1",
  "id": "oort",
  "name": "The Oculus",
  "about": "The vertical slice's mission (design section 3): a strike at Earth's early-warning outpost, built into a comet nucleus at the edge of the Oort Cloud. A quiet opening among the ice; the whole strike group goes dark while the outpost sweeps for life (being seen is not a failure: the outpost wakes early, scrambles sooner and starts its warning sooner); the strike; waves of Earth's fighters on FS2's two-thirds rule with a time-out, and the comms array to knock out before the warning gets home (if it gets out, a heavier response arrives late: harder, not failed); a corvette, then a destroyer with beams and a bomber wing going for the Small Mercy; a heavy hit the player must repair by hand; the destroyer crippled so our cruisers can finish it; the outpost falls. The outpost (earth_outpost) and the destroyer (earth_destroyer) are placeholders drawn from this file's looks; a ShipArt model of either class replaces it without this file changing (parts are addressed by kind: comms, hangar, turret, engine). Every radio line is a draft pending the user's approval: not voiced.",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "player": "Sable 1",
  "teams": ["diaspora", "earth"],
  "linesPending": true,
  "linesPendingWhy": "the user approves every line before any voice is made (design: the dialogue process); until then they play as radio text with the squelch",
  "arrivalCap": { "team": "earth", "value": [3, 4, 5, 6, 8], "valueWhy": "ours: at most this many of Earth's capped fighters alive at once per level; the bombers, their escort, the hull-threshold wing and the late response come on top" },
  "cabin": {
    "start": "table",
    "standAnytime": true,
    "rack": { "guns": ["needle", "hammer"], "missiles": ["missile_heat", "missile_lock", "torpedo_heavy"], "defaultGuns": ["needle", "hammer"], "defaultMissiles": ["missile_lock", "torpedo_heavy"] }
  },
  "music": { "start": "ambient", "auto": false,
             "tracks": { "ambient": "oort_ambient", "battle1": "oort_battle_1", "battle2": "oort_battle_2", "battle3": "oort_battle_3", "victory": "oort_victory", "failure": "oort_failure" },
             "tracksWhy": "names for the user's own tracks (music/<name>.mp3 in the Audio folder); without a file each falls back to the built-in score" },
  "pacing": { "hulls": ["Small Mercy", "Oculus", "Cantor", "Archon", "Patience"], "quietRange": 3000,
              "ranges": ["Sable 1 | Small Mercy", "Small Mercy | Oculus", "Small Mercy | Cantor", "Small Mercy | Archon", "Patience | Oculus"] },

  "briefing": {
    "title": "The Oculus",
    "stages": [
      "The Oculus is Earth's early-warning outpost at the edge of the cloud, dug into a comet. It listens for anything coming in. If it hears us and calls home, the inner system knows we are coming.",
      "The Small Mercy drops us seven kilometres short. When the outpost sweeps, the whole group goes dark: out of the seat, main breaker off, drift with the ice until it has passed.",
      "Then we go in. Take the comms array first if you can. Earth will send what it has. Keep the bombers off the Mercy."
    ],
    "questions": [
      { "q": "What are the objectives", "a": "Destroy the outpost. Keep the Small Mercy flying. Knock out the comms array before the warning gets out." },
      { "q": "What opposition will there be", "a": "The outpost's guns and whatever is in its hangar, fighters in waves, a corvette. Possibly a destroyer. It has beams." },
      { "q": "What if the sweep finds us", "a": "Then they are ready sooner and the warning starts sooner. We still go in." }
    ]
  },
  "debriefing": [
    { "when": { "objective": "outpost" }, "text": "The Oculus is gone. Earth's ear at the edge of the cloud is shut." },
    { "when": { "objective": "comms" }, "text": "The comms array went down before the warning finished. The inner system heard nothing." },
    { "when": { "objective": "comms", "is": "failed" }, "text": "The warning got out. Earth knows where we came in, and it will be waiting further in." },
    { "when": { "not": { "detected": "Oculus" } }, "text": "The sweep took you for ice." },
    { "when": { "detected": "Oculus" }, "text": "The sweep found you, and the outpost was awake when we went in." },
    { "when": { "objective": "mercy", "is": "failed" }, "text": "We lost the Small Mercy." },
    { "when": { "objective": "archon" }, "text": "One Earth destroyer fewer." }
  ],

